Description: BlueMesh embedder service (hardened build)
 Ships the service as compiled CPython extensions rather than readable source.
 One package serves x86_64 and aarch64: an extension's filename encodes the
 platform and interpreter, so each host loads only the .so built for it.
 .
 Installs to /data/app/prod/embedder and registers the bluemesh-embedder systemd unit on port 8252.
 Python dependencies are installed into a private virtualenv by the post-install
 step; that requires network access.

